<h2 id="a11y-unreachable-title">Clickable, but not reachable</h2>
<p id="a11y-unreachable-desc">Fixture: rows with a click handler that no keyboard can reach.</p>
<div class="card">
  <div class="a11y-row" onclick="a11yPick(1)">One</div>
  <span class="a11y-chip" onclick="a11yPick(2)">Two</span>
</div>
